  "title": "Chicken and corn rice bowl",
  "blurb": "Tender chicken with sweetcorn and rice, topped with cottage cheese and fresh coriander",
  "steps": [
    "Cook the rice in boiling water according to packet instructions, then drain if needed and keep warm.",
    "Cut the chicken into bite-sized pieces and toss with the paprika, cumin, cayenne and a pinch of salt.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a frying pan over medium-high heat and cook the chicken for 6 to 8 minutes, turning occasionally, until golden and cooked through.",
    "Add the drained sweetcorn to the pan and cook for 2 minutes to warm through.",
    "Spoon the rice into a bowl and top with the chicken and corn mixture.",
    "Add the cottage cheese on top, tear over the coriander leaves, and squeeze over the lime juice before serving."
